-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",75,{
[2369]="700358FE\n1\tDefeat Kurr and collect his tooth\tKurr romps in the north-eastern plains of the Whitshaws, hiding among some tall rocks near the fishermens' home. You should summon and defeat Kurr, and collect his tooth.\n2\tBring Kurr's tooth to Britric\tBritric is in Forlaw. You have collected the tooth of Kurr, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.\n",
[2370]="7005A955\n1\tDefeat Kurthár\030Defeat cave-beasts in Máttugard (total: 12)\030Collect the claw of Kurthár for Agátur\tKurthár and cave-beasts can be found in Máttugard. You should defeat cave-beasts.\n2\tBring the claw of Kurthár to Agátur\tAgátur can be found at Steepset in Máttugard. You should bring the claw of Kurthár to Agátur.\n",
[2371]="70066613\n1\tFind and defeat Kurzglok in Lhingroth\tKurzglok can be found somewhere in the caverns of Lhingorth in the Blackroot Vale. A bounty posted by Melril of Sardol seeks for a skilled hunter to seek out and defeat the spider, Kurzglok, in the caverns of Lhingroth.\n2\tDeliver Kurzglok's mandibles to Melril in Sardol\tMelril can be found in Sardol in the Blackroot Vale. You have defeated Kurzglok and taken its mandibles. You should deliver them to Melril in Sardol.\n",
[2372]="70042EB2\n1\tSpeak with Derufin\tDerufin can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Derufin.\n2\tDefeat Langarch\tLangarch can be found somewhere in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Langarch.\n3\tSpeak with Derufin\tDerufin can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Derufin.\n",
[2373]="7006AA43\n1\tDefeat the morroval Legwêna\tLegwêna is located in the western side of Ilmabiri; the Wells.\n2\tTalk to Porókho\tYou have defeated the morroval, Legwêna. You should return to Porókho at his camp in Hêbatokh to claim your reward.\n",
[2374]="7006BF77\n1\tTeach Luhum-gêna in Zahûmakh a lesson\tUsakâr's bounty asks you to teach Luhum-gêna in Zahûmakh a lesson for stealing and eating his hat, then go to Dag Usakâra, located south of Urmâkh, to claim your reward.\n2\tFind Usakâr near his home and report Luhum-gêna's defeat\tFind Usakâr near his home of Dag Usakâra, located midway between Urmâkh and Vartúlin, and tell him about Luhum-gêna's defeat.\n",
[2375]="70042EB3\n1\tSpeak with Duilin\tDuilin can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Duilin.\n2\tDefeat Maeganc\tMaeganc can be found somewhere in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Maeganc.\n3\tSpeak with Duilin\tDuilin can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Duilin.\n",
[2376]="70053DC0\n1\tDefeat fell spirits in Emyn Duir (total: 8)\030Defeat Mangath in Emyn Duir\tFell spirits can be found in Emyn Duir. You should defeat Mangath and other fell spirits that roam Emyn Duir.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated fell spirits.\n",
[2377]="70071AD6\n1\tDefeat Manyêki\tManyêki can usually be found south of Jiret-menêsh in the Hills of Haramûl. You should go there and defeat it.\n2\tTalk to Mísikir in Jiret-menêsh\tYou have defeated the grodbog Manyêki. You should return to Jiret-menêsh to collect your reward.\n",
[2378]="700358A9\n1\tDefeat Marr and collect his pauldrons\tMarr can be found camping on a hilltop south-west of the ruined town of Scylfig. You should summon and defeat Marr and collect his pauldrons.\n2\tBring the pauldrons to Britric\tBritric is in Forlaw. You have defeated Marr, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.\n",
[2379]="7004E90D\n1\tDefeat Moorstalker\030Defeat Mithrin wolves (total: 10)\tMoorstalker and Mithrin wolves can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should defeat wolves.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Moorstalker.\n",
[2380]="70067CAF\n1\tThe bounty requests the recovery of a silver-inlaid locket and proof that the best, Nakhrûd, was slain. Nakhrûd is said to nest among its brood to the east of Halrax.\t\n2\tReturn the locket and fang to Hannax at the tavern in Halrax\tAfter a quick battle, you dispatched Nakhrûd and took its fang, recovered the locket, and prepared to return to Hannax in the town of Halrax.\n",
[2381]="700715A9\n1\tDefeat Nâralarg and collect his blighted root\tYou are to defeat Nâralarg, the Blighted Root before he can spread noxious disease throughout Kighân. Return to Nazâkh in Zajâna with a sample of his blighted roots to show proof of his demise. He can be found in the blighted grove of Shádhag, near Adagím.\n2\tBring Nâralarg's root to Nazâkh in Zajâna\tBring Nâralarg's root to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.\n",
[2382]="70053DC3\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Arandor (total: 8)\030Defeat Orc lieutenants in Arandor (total: 2)\tOrc soldiers can be found in Arandor. You should defeat Orc soldiers and lieutenants.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Orc soldiers.\n",
[2383]="70053DBF\n1\tDefeat Morgul Captains in Rath Dúath (total: 5)\030Defeat Morgul warg-masters in Rath Dúath (total: 5)\tStrong Orcs can be found in Rath Dúath. You should defeat Morgul Captains and warg-masters.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated strong Orcs.\n",
[2384]="70068F38\n1\tDefeat the Bel Inzûl proto-beast\tGather a fellowship and make your way to the north-western stones of Bel Inzûl. Defeat the Bel Inzûl proto-beast.\n2\tSpeak with the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl\tYou defeated the menace in the north-western stones. Return to the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl to claim your reward.\n",
[2385]="70068F36\n1\tDefeat the Bel Inzûl proto-crab\tGather a fellowship and make your way to the western side of Bel Inzûl. Defeat the Bel Inzûl proto-crab.\n2\tSpeak with the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl\tYou defeated the menace on the northern shore. Return to the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl to claim your reward.\n",
[2386]="70068F37\n1\tDefeat the Bel Inzûl proto-crow\tGather a fellowship and make your way to the western side of Bel Inzûl. Defeat the Bel Inzûl proto-crow.\n2\tSpeak with the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl\tYou defeated the menace in the western skies. Return to the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl to claim your reward.\n",
[2387]="70068F35\n1\tDefeat the Bel Inzûl proto-huorn\tGather a fellowship and make your way to the ruins atop of Bel Inzûl. Defeat the Bel Inzûl proto-huorn.\n2\tSpeak with the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl\tYou defeated the menace among the ruins. Return to the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl to claim your reward.\n",
[2388]="70068F39\n1\tDefeat the Bel Inzûl proto-salamander\tGather a fellowship and make your way to the eastern side of Bel Inzûl. Defeat the Bel Inzûl proto-salamander.\n2\tSpeak with the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl\tYou defeated the menace in the western skies. Return to the healer at the outpost on Bel Inzûl to claim your reward.\n",
[2389]="7006AA3D\n1\tDefeat bog-lurkers within western Dil-irmíz (total: 10)\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of bog-lurkers near Jadambor to help make the roads safer.\n2\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have defeated bog-lurkers in the area\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have defeated bog-lurkers in the area.\n",
[2390]="7006AA3C\n1\tDefeat shades within western Dil-irmíz (total: 16)\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number shades in the area to prevent Jadambor from being overrun.\n2\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have defeated shades in the area\t\n",
[2391]="7006C6D2\n1\tDefeat Rakhûl\tA bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat the wasp Rakhûl in the Gorge of Woe to the north-east.\n2\tReturn to Neshurga and inform him of Rakhûl's defeat\tReturn to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Rakhûl.\n",
[2392]="7003FDA7\n1\tRecover stolen treasure from Corsairs (total: 15)\030Defeat Rilgell, the vault-robber\tStolen treasure from the vault of Calembel can be found on Corsairs in northern Lamedon. You should recover stolen treasures from the Corsairs.\n2\tCollect your reward from Laindir\tLaindir can be found in Calembel in Lamedon. You should return to Laindir and collect your reward for recovering the stolen goods.\n",
[2393]="70041365\n1\tInteract with Gondorian Refugee\tGondorian refugees can be found just south of Tungobel in central Dor-en-Ernil. Seek out and rescue any refugees in Dor-en-Ernil.\n2\tSpeak with Glírdor\tGlírdor is in Erchar's encampment in Dor-en-Ernil. You should speak with Glírdor.\n",
[2394]="70042EB1\n1\tSpeak with Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Thurindol.\n2\tDefeat Ronkúrz\tRonkúrz can be found somewhere in Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Ronkúrz.\n3\tSpeak with Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Thurindol.\n",
[2395]="700413CA\n1\tDefeat Ruthless Dead in Ringló Vale (total: 10)\tRuthless dead can be found throughout Ringló Vale. Defeat Ruthless Dead in Ringló Vale.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Ruthless Dead in Ringló Vale.\n",
[2396]="7004541D\n1\tDefeat foes atop Eilenach (total: 4)\030Defeat foes atop Amon Dîn (total: 4)\tThe beacons of Amon Dîn and Eilenach can be found in Taur Drúadan. You should defeat any enemies gathered at these beacons.\n2\tSpeak with Dúnhere\tDúnhere can be found in the War-stead of the Helmingas. You should speak with Dúnhere.\n",
[2397]="700715A6\n1\tDefeat Shahâk and collect her mighty fang\tShahâk, pup of the dread jázga Bloodtooth, has been harassing travellers on the Great Road north of Zajâna. Defeat her and return to Nazâkh in Zajâna with one of her fangs as proof of her demise. She is said to haunt the lands near Dân Shatagan, north-east of Zajâna.\n2\tBring Shahâk's fang to Nazâkh in Zajâna\tBring Shahâk's fang to Nazâkh in Zajâna to collect your reward.\n",
[2398]="70035900\n1\tDefeat Shakolam and collect his bracer\tShakolam can be found on the southern part of the Orc-made road in the Balewood. You should summon and defeat Shakolam, and collect his bracer.\n2\tBring the bracer to Britric\tBritric is in Forlaw. You have collected the bracer of Shakolam, and should now return to Forlaw to collect your bounty.\n",
[2399]="70071B3F\n1\tDefeat Shálith\tA bounty notice asks you to defeat a monstrous sicklefly called Shálith that has been spotted in Saig Hathíl in Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof.\n2\tReturn to Sálunath with proof of Shálith's demise\tYou defeated Shálith and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.\n",
[2400]="7001C073\n1\tBring the gizzards to Glaednoth\030Collect sickle-fly gizzards (total: 10)\tSickle-flies can be found throughout the swamp of Harloeg. Glaednoth is located at Ost Haer in the southernmost reaches of Harloeg. Glaednoth has asked you to collect gizzards from the sickle-flies of Harloeg. NOTE: Bounty quests are repeatable quests, but have a finite number of completions. This quest can be completed three times.\n",
})
